  <Document>
    <name>VT 407 — journey 2 moved, then boundary lockout</name>
    <description>Snapshot 2026-10-08 06:53:24.640 Australia/Brisbane. Initial hold is accepted by design and is not the issue illustrated here. Journey 2 was planned at 06:53:23.166. The reported drone position crossed the original central boundary; remaining leg and recovery were rejected despite saved destination remaining sea-side. No route is invented.</description>
