      <name>D1 — STOPPED, 0.284 m beachward</name>
      <description>Reported aircraft at 06:53:24.640. VT commands zero forward/right. Failed rule: route_central_boundary. Recovery result: start_beachward_of_boundary. GPS data alone cannot separate physical drift from positioning noise.</description>
      <styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl>
      <Point>
        <altitudeMode>clampToGround</altitudeMode>
        <coordinates>153.391036678255,-28.080699384415,0</coordinates>
